# Cloudflare Workers static-assets response headers (https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/).
# Caching is left at the platform default (revalidate every request): the service worker precaches
# everything, so long browser-cache lifetimes would add nothing and could pin stale 404s.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  # script-src is not restricted: compiling the LAME .wasm under a script-src policy needs
  # 'wasm-unsafe-eval', which older Safari versions do not recognise.
  Content-Security-Policy: object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
